OL,3,GNEWSA'Keep walking': 100-year-old still
OL,4,Adoes mile a day
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor 100-year-old Peter Byers, the
OL,7,Fsecret to a long, active life is to
OL,8,F"keep happy, keep walking and "keep
OL,9,Fbreathing".
OL,11,FThe father of five from Pocklington,
OL,12,FEast Yorkshire, said he walked into
OL,13,Ftown most days "to make sure people
OL,14,Fknow I'm still alive."
OL,16,FPeter, who underwent heart surgery five
OL,17,Fyears ago, also enjoys week-long
OL,18,Ffishing breaks with his son.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
