OL,3,GNEWSA'Keep walking': 100-year-old still
OL,4,Adoes mile a day
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said his mobility scooter was
OL,7,Fgathering dust in the garage, adding:
OL,8,F"I go and charge it up regularly like
OL,9,FI'm supposed to, but it's never moved."
